## CDW Expands AI Ecosystem Through New DevRev Alliance Built Using OpenAI Models


November 19, 2026


*New alliance combines DevRev's AI-native platform, OpenAI model capabilities and CDW's services expertise to help organizations move from AI experimentation to measurable business outcomes*


LAS VEGAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--


CDW (Nasdaq: CDW), the strategic end-to-end technology partner that turns customer ambition into outcomes, today announced a new go-to-market alliance with[DevRev](https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&url=https%3A%2F%2Fdevrev.ai%2F&esheet=54643747&newsitemid=20261119564086&lan=en-US&anchor=DevRev&index=1&md5=9b4db675f9d708ede314a5a0bc0c6ffc) , the enterprise AI platform that automates resolution of customer and employee requests, using OpenAI models. The alliance will combine CDW’s services expertise with DevRev’s AI platform with a goal to help organizations automate routine customer and employee service requests. DevRev uses OpenAI models to help automate those requests.


As organizations move beyond AI experimentation and focus on deployment at scale, many are seeking practical ways to apply AI within existing business processes and workflows. Customer and employee service are two areas where AI can make an immediate difference, helping organizations handle growing request volumes without increasing manual effort.


Announced at CDW's 2026 Partner Summit, the alliance reflects CDW's continued focus on bringing innovative technologies and strategic partnerships together to help customers navigate emerging opportunities and challenges in AI.


“Organizations increasingly want to move beyond AI pilots and identify where these technologies can create meaningful business value,” said **Conor Waddell, SVP, Solutions & Services Presales and Partner & Product Management at CDW** . “By bringing together DevRev's innovation and CDW's expertise, we will help customers accelerate adoption and focus on outcomes. This alliance is also a strong example of how we are activating our partner ecosystem to bring new capabilities and opportunities to customers.”


DevRev connects an organization’s knowledge and work across its existing systems, giving AI the context to provide grounded answers and take actions within established permissions and policies. Through the alliance, CDW will help customers deploy DevRev's AI capabilities, including Computer and Operator, to support business transformation and AI adoption initiatives. By leveraging Computer and Operator, companies can resolve routine requests autonomously, move complex work forward faster, and free up people to focus on work that requires human judgment and expertise. DevRev combines OpenAI technology with the enterprise context and controls needed to carry out that work.


“AI should make self-service work for employees and customers,” said **Adnan Bhutta, CVP of Growth at DevRev.** “Together, DevRev’s AI Operator and Computer help people take autonomous action with precision, efficiency, and safety. We’re excited to work with CDW to bring these practical outcomes to more organizations.”


The alliance also highlights the growing importance of ecosystems in driving enterprise AI adoption, bringing together technology platforms, innovation partners and implementation expertise to help organizations deploy AI with confidence.


“AI adoption happens through strong ecosystems that help customers apply technology to real business challenges,” said **Mollie Javerbaum, Go-to-Market, OpenAI** . “We're excited to see companies like DevRev build innovative experiences using frontier OpenAI models and work with organizations like CDW to help customers put AI into practice.”


**About CDW**


CDW Corporation (Nasdaq: CDW) is the strategic end-to-end technology partner that cuts through complexity to turn customer ambition into outcomes. Working with organizations across the business, government, education and healthcare sectors in the United States, the United Kingdom and Canada, CDW enables organizations to navigate an increasingly complex technology market and turn their technology investments into lasting value. For more information about CDW, please visit CDW.com.


**About DevRev**


DevRev is an enterprise AI company that helps organizations make their collective capability available to customers and employees. Its platform connects enterprise business systems with permissions intact to power employee self-service through enterprise search and internal service desks, and customer self-service through conversational support across chat, email, and voice.


Founded in 2021, DevRev is led by co-founder and CEO Dheeraj Pandey and co-founder Manoj Agarwal. Headquartered in Palo Alto, DevRev operates globally across eight offices. For more information, visit devrev.ai. DevRev media contact:DevRev@watersagency.com


